    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d453">

                <pb facs="0556" n="482" xml:id="pg482"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/8732</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Russia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Francis</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Petrograd</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-01-31T18:00:00+02:31">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 31, 1918, 6 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received February 3, 4.11
                        a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2309. Your 2014. French Ambassador informs us that he received no instructions
                    from his Government to protest against retaliatory measures against Rumanian
                    subjects in Russia. As he of course participated in joint protest of Diplomatic
                    Corps against arrest of Rumanian Minister and as the latter has now been
                    expelled from Russia<anchor n="1" xml:id="d453-f1"/> further action or protest
                    appears to be useless.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Francis</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d453-f1" n="1" xml:id="d453-f1-content">
                <p>For the further developments in relations between Russia and Rumania, see <ref
                        target="frus1918Russiav02">vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">ii</hi></ref>,
                    chap. v.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
